		"excerpt": "B\"H Ohr HaGnuz: I Did Not Forget This pass turns the game from loose systems into a real gameplay spine. Beginning The player starts in the first village with the guide ג. The road east now opens into the Garden of Ungiven Things. Middle The player collects five entrusted gifts: Terumah, First Tithe, Poor Tithe, Second",
		"searchText": "b\"h ohr hagnuz: i did not forget this pass turns the game from loose systems into a real gameplay spine. beginning the player starts in the first village with the guide ג. the road east now opens into the garden of ungiven things. middle the player collects five entrusted gifts: terumah, first tithe, poor tithe, second tithe, and bikkurim. each gift has a receiver and an order. the court of rightful receivers teaches that holiness is given, not sold. end the house of forgetting checks whether the player removed the holy from the house, gave to the levi, gave to the poor, remembered blessing, shared joy, and restored flavor to fruit. files added data/rambam/ yesod/rambam/ data/maps/rambamgiftmaps.js portalindexrambam.js questindexrambam.js storyindexrambam.js encounterindexrambam.js rambammusagspecies.js files rewritten state.js tilelexicon.js worldmaps.js portalindex.js ohrencounter.js questindex.js storyindex.js encounterindex.js musagspecies.js the next major pass should update the ui visuals so the player sees the declaration checklist without opening dev logs.",
